; the kit's picture with its hex legend. The book is ordered by grade, 32 a grade, so a
; puzzle's grade is the block it stands in.
; ---- the book, written by cargo run --release --example seiyaku: edit the generator, never these lines ----
(picture "Book" "A1" hex
